1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Fatherland, Fatherland, Timor-Leste, our Nation.

2
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Glory to the people and to the heroes of our liberation.

3
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Fatherland, Motherland, Timor-Leste, our Nation.

4
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Glory to the people and to the heroes of our liberation.

5
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:16,000
We conquered colonialism, we shout:

6
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Down with imperialism.

7
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Free land, free people,

8
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:37,000
No, no, no to exploitation.

9
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Onwards, united, firm and determined.

10
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,000
In the struggle against imperialism

11
00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The enemy of the peoples, until the final victory

12
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
On the path of revolution.